== Trivia ==
* The {{Rare}} ability, '''Higher Ground''', is likely a reference to the famous quote from ''Star Wars: Revenge of the Sith'' when Anakin Skywalker and Obi-Wan Kenobi duel each other.
* The {{Legendary}} variant's ability comes from a former ability of the [[Ocelot Pet]], Evasion. It has been renamed, buffed, and moved onto this pet.

